  "headline": "Delhi Police Apprehend Teen For Selling Stolen Agniveer Data Online",
  "seoTitle": "Teen Arrested for Selling Stolen Agniveer Data Online",
  "metaDescription": "Delhi Police have arrested a 14-year-old student who allegedly used an AI chatbot to infiltrate an Agniveer recruitment portal and sell data on the dark web.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "A 14-year-old was apprehended by Delhi Police for hacking an Agniveer recruitment website.",
    "The suspect reportedly utilized an AI chatbot to identify vulnerabilities and extract private information.",
    "Investigators stated the stolen data, which included names and addresses of approximately 4,000 individuals, was offered for sale on the dark web."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "Delhi Police have taken a 14-year-old into custody following allegations that the student successfully breached an Agniveer recruitment test portal. According to official sources, the teenager employed an artificial intelligence chatbot to assist in identifying security vulnerabilities within the testing website. The investigation indicates that the individual managed to gain unauthorized access to the portal to obtain personal data, including the names and residential addresses of roughly 4,000 applicants. The stolen information was subsequently listed for sale on the dark web. Authorities are currently examining the extent of the unauthorized access, noting that preliminary findings suggest the breach was limited to contact information rather than sensitive examination material. The arrest follows reports of the teen attempting to monetize the illicitly acquired database through various online channels.",
